    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">AiliA is a tricky puzzle game where mirror reflections are made real. Manipulate mirrors and guide Ail through a stunning, reflected world to save her long-lost &quot;twin sister&quot; Lia, who was captured inside a mirror. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677100/extras/0ad14d79e01710b20ce1845637dfad51.avif?t=1754107683\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Go into the mirrors and traverse through the reflections.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Move, flip, and rotate mirrors to manipulate the world around you. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677100/extras/eb41413fd617fa09c50c493037a08829.poster.avif?t=1754107683\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677100/extras/eb41413fd617fa09c50c493037a08829.webm?t=1754107683\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677100/extras/eb41413fd617fa09c50c493037a08829.mp4?t=1754107683\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677100/extras/dfe70b21976df0bef96e6c04836c25ed.avif?t=1754107683\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Navigate through 7 unique worlds inspired by Chinese mythology.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Solve 100+ hand-crafted puzzles.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677100/extras/2dd67edf0b54ba587b981fc5a8f91c5b.poster.avif?t=1754107683\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677100/extras/2dd67edf0b54ba587b981fc5a8f91c5b.webm?t=1754107683\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677100/extras/2dd67edf0b54ba587b981fc5a8f91c5b.mp4?t=1754107683\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677100/extras/d9fca04e5864feebb858508a275005c9.avif?t=1754107683\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect mirror shards in secret areas with impossible challenges.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Recover your lost memory from mirror shards.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677100/extras/87653c19f2b20cda78e67592c3f1e035.poster.avif?t=1754107683\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677100/extras/87653c19f2b20cda78e67592c3f1e035.webm?t=1754107683\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677100/extras/87653c19f2b20cda78e67592c3f1e035.mp4?t=1754107683\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
